        "ai_gen_block_71ee8d6_exGJti": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_71ee8d6",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<style>\n.siv-faq{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px 60px;color:inherit;font-family:inherit}\n.siv-faq h2.siv-faq__section{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 10px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;opacity:.9}\n.siv-faq h2.siv-faq__section:first-child,.siv-faq .siv-faq__title+h2.siv-faq__section{margin-top:0}\n.siv-faq details{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.12)}\n.siv-faq summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}\n.siv-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n.siv-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";font-size:22px;font-weight:300;line-height:1;flex:none;transition:transform .2s ease}\n.siv-faq details[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(45deg)}\n.siv-faq .siv-faq__answer{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;max-width:760px}\n.siv-faq .siv-faq__answer p{margin:0 0 10px}\n.siv-faq .siv-faq__answer ul{margin:4px 0 10px 20px;padding:0}\n.siv-faq .siv-faq__answer a{text-decoration:underline;color:inherit;word-break:break-word}\n.siv-faq .siv-faq__title{text-align:center;margin:0 0 40px}\n@media (max-width:640px){.siv-faq{padding:28px 16px 48px}.siv-faq summary{font-size:16px}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"siv-faq\">\n  <h1 class=\"siv-faq__title h1\">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>\n  <h2 class=\"siv-faq__section\">Product Basics</h2>\n  <details>\n    <summary>What is SIV Biome Balancing Serum?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>SIV Biome Balancing Serum is a spore-based serum made with Bacillus spores and skin-identical lipids. It is formulated to support a healthy, balanced skin microbiome and skin barrier, and it is designed to fit into any skincare routine.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Why does my serum have clumps?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Clumping is completely expected. Our serum is made without fillers or suspension agents, so nothing in the bottle holds the particles in place or makes them invisible. Shaking spreads the particles through the serum, but it won't dissolve them, so you'll still see some in a range of sizes. They melt into the skin as you apply. Temperature during shipping can also play a role, so colder areas may see larger clusters.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Why does my serum settle at the bottom of the bottle?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Settling is normal for the same reason. When the bottle sits, the particles settle again within minutes. Just shake well before each use.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How much should I shake the bottle?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Shake vigorously before every use until the sediment lifts off the bottom and spreads through the serum.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Why does my serum have a scent?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Our serum doesn't contain any added fragrance, so the scent you notice comes from the ingredients themselves. It's most noticeable when you first open the bottle, softens as you apply, and fades quickly after application.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How do I use the dropper?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Gently press the dropper to release a small amount of serum.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How long does a bottle last?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>The 15 mL bottle lasts about 30 days with once-daily use.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How should I store my serum?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Store it at room temperature and away from sunlight. No refrigeration is needed, and refrigerating it won't make a difference.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How long is my serum good for once it's opened?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>We recommend finishing your bottle within 4 months of opening.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <h2 class=\"siv-faq__section\">Using SIV</h2>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Who is SIV for?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Everyone has a skin microbiome, so SIV is made for all skin types as part of a daily routine.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Where does SIV go in my routine?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Apply SIV after cleansing and toning, and before any other serums, moisturizer, and SPF. If you use a leave-on benzoyl peroxide product, use it at the opposite time of day from SIV unless a licensed provider has advised otherwise.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Can I use SIV with my other skincare products?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Yes. SIV can be used alongside your other skincare products.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Can I use SIV on my body?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Absolutely. You can use SIV on other parts of your body, not just your face. Some people apply 1 to 2 drops directly to the area, and some mix a drop or two into a moisturizer of their choosing.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Do you offer samples?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>We don't offer samples of any kind.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <h2 class=\"siv-faq__section\">Biome Balance Within</h2>\n  <details>\n    <summary>What is Biome Balance Within?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Biome Balance Within is our spore-based oral probiotic supplement. Each bottle contains 60 capsules. Please follow the directions on the label.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Can I order Biome Balance Within outside the United States?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Biome Balance Within is only available in the United States.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <h2 class=\"siv-faq__section\">Ingredients and Safety</h2>\n  <details>\n    <summary>What's in the serum?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>SIV Biome Balancing Serum is made with Bacillus spores and skin-identical lipids: squalane, caprylic/capric triglyceride, and glyceryl caprylate. It contains no added fragrance, fillers, or suspension agents.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Is there anything I should know before using SIV?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Don't use SIV if you're allergic to any of its ingredients, and stop using it if irritation occurs. If the serum gets in your eyes, rinse them right away with water.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Can I use SIV while pregnant or breastfeeding?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Please check with your healthcare provider before using SIV if you are pregnant or breastfeeding.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Can teens use SIV?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>SIV is intended for adults. Anyone under 18 should check with a parent or guardian and a healthcare provider before use.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <h2 class=\"siv-faq__section\">Orders and Shipping</h2>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Can I cancel or change my order?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Orders can be cancelled or changed within 24 hours of purchase, as long as they haven't shipped yet. Email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@sivcare.com\">info@sivcare.com</a> as soon as possible with your order number. Once an order has shipped, it can no longer be changed.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Can I change my shipping address?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Address changes need to happen before your order ships. Email <a href=\"mailto:info@sivcare.com\">info@sivcare.com</a> right away with your order number and new address. Once your order has shipped, the address can't be changed.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Do you ship to PO boxes?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>We are not able to ship to PO boxes.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Do you ship internationally?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>We offer international shipping to many countries. Shipping costs are calculated at checkout based on the destination and order size. Any customs fees, duties, import taxes, or other charges from the destination country are the recipient's responsibility and are not included in our shipping rates. Because customs rules vary by country, we cannot guarantee customs clearance, and shipments may be delayed, refused, or returned by customs.</p><p>Biome Balance Within is only available in the United States.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>My package says delivered, but I don't have it.</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Carriers sometimes mark packages as delivered 1 to 3 business days before they actually arrive. Please check around your property, with neighbors, and with your local post office. If it still hasn't arrived after 2 business days, email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@sivcare.com\">info@sivcare.com</a> and we'll take care of it.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>The silver collar came off my bottle. Is my serum okay?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Yes. The silver collar on our bottles can occasionally slip off, but it doesn't change the serum inside in any way, and your serum is still good to use.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>I received the wrong item.</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Please email <a href=\"mailto:info@sivcare.com\">info@sivcare.com</a> with your order number and a photo of what you received, and we'll make it right.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <h2 class=\"siv-faq__section\">Subscriptions and Returns</h2>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How do I manage my subscription?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>You can update, pause, or cancel your subscription at any time from Manage Subscription on our website. Log in with the email connected to your subscription. If you need help, email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@sivcare.com\">info@sivcare.com</a>.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>What is your return policy?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>We accept returns within 30 days of purchase. We are not able to accept returns of used products. To be eligible, the serum box must still have its shrink wrap intact, and Biome Balance Within must still have its clear neck band intact. Refunds are issued once the returned product arrives back at our warehouse unopened. To start a return, email <a href=\"mailto:info@sivcare.com\">info@sivcare.com</a> with your order number.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <h2 class=\"siv-faq__section\">Wholesale and Professionals</h2>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How can I carry SIV?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>We'd love to have you! Please complete our wholesale application at <a href=\"https://sivcare.com/pages/wholesale-enquiry\">https://sivcare.com/pages/wholesale-enquiry</a>. Once you're approved, you'll receive a welcome email with everything you need to get started, including wholesale pricing and how to place your first order.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>I'm in New Zealand, Australia, or Europe. How do I carry SIV?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Please reach out to our local partners:</p><ul><li><strong>New Zealand:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:support@fxmed.co.nz\">support@fxmed.co.nz</a></li><li><strong>Australia:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:support@therahealth.com.au\">support@therahealth.com.au</a></li><li><strong>Europe:</strong> open an account at <a href=\"https://www.siveurope.com\">www.siveurope.com</a></li></ul></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How do I log in to my wholesale account?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Go to sivcare.com and select Login in the upper right corner. Enter the email address connected to your wholesale account (please don't use Shop Pay), then enter the one-time code sent to your inbox. Wholesale pricing appears in your cart once you meet the minimum order.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>I'm logged in, but I'm not seeing wholesale pricing.</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Make sure you're logged in with your SIV wholesale email and not Shop Pay, and that you have at least 2 bottles of the same size in your cart. If pricing still isn't showing, email <a href=\"mailto:info@sivcare.com\">info@sivcare.com</a> and we'll update your account.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <h2 class=\"siv-faq__section\">Contact</h2>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How can I reach SIV?</summary>\n    <div class=\"siv-faq__answer\"><p>Email us anytime at <a href=\"mailto:info@sivcare.com\">info@sivcare.com</a> and our team will be happy to help.</p></div>\n  </details>\n</div>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is SIV Biome Balancing Serum?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"SIV Biome Balancing Serum is a spore-based serum made with Bacillus spores and skin-identical lipids. It is formulated to support a healthy, balanced skin microbiome and skin barrier, and it is designed to fit into any skincare routine.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why does my serum have clumps?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Clumping is completely expected. Our serum is made without fillers or suspension agents, so nothing in the bottle holds the particles in place or makes them invisible. Shaking spreads the particles through the serum, but it won't dissolve them, so you'll still see some in a range of sizes. They melt into the skin as you apply. Temperature during shipping can also play a role, so colder areas may see larger clusters.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why does my serum settle at the bottom of the bottle?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Settling is normal for the same reason. When the bottle sits, the particles settle again within minutes. Just shake well before each use.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much should I shake the bottle?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Shake vigorously before every use until the sediment lifts off the bottom and spreads through the serum.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why does my serum have a scent?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Our serum doesn't contain any added fragrance, so the scent you notice comes from the ingredients themselves. It's most noticeable when you first open the bottle, softens as you apply, and fades quickly after application.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I use the dropper?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Gently press the dropper to release a small amount of serum.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does a bottle last?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The 15 mL bottle lasts about 30 days with once-daily use.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How should I store my serum?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":",
